/ Stage 9 (decisions 138–141): every plang value is born through its type's Create, so a program can bind a value's
/ birth. Today file.read makes its file with `new`, so "after file create" misses it. The file is saved before the
/ binding, so only the read counts.
Start
- save "spec_create.txt" with content "x"
- set %created% = 0
- after file create, call CountCreated
- read file "spec_create.txt", write to %file%
- assert %created% equals 1, "reading a file is the birth of a file value"
- delete file "spec_create.txt"

CountCreated
- set %created% = %created% + 1
